sequenceDiagram
  participant App as App lifecycle
  participant Repo as ProgressRepository
  participant R as Room
  participant API as api.mimo.org
  App->>Repo: trigger push
  Repo->>R: select WHERE in_queue=1
  R-->>Repo: rows
  Repo->>API: POST /v1/tutorials/{tutorialId}/progress {progressList}
  API-->>Repo: 200 {reachedGoal, dailyGoalCoinReward}
  Repo->>R: delete pushed rows
